     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "See the following discussion: ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://java.net/projects/glassfish/lists/users/archive/2011-01/message/94"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://java.net/projects/glassfish/lists/users/archive/2011-01/message/94",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "The above discussion suggests using the GlassFish Nexus Server (",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://maven.glassfish.org/content/groups/glassfish)"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://maven.glassfish.org/content/groups/glassfish)",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " to obtain the dependency and also notes the following from an Oracle employee: \"In the future, the plan is to publish the Java EE API JARs to Maven central.  Community should be able to set dependencies on Java EE API artifacts w/o adding repository element.\"",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
