     "body": "<p>See the following discussion: <a href=\"http://java.net/projects/glassfish/lists/users/archive/2011-01/message/94\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://java.net/projects/glassfish/lists/users/archive/2011-01/message/94</a></p>\n\n<p>The above discussion suggests using the GlassFish Nexus Server (<a href=\"http://maven.glassfish.org/content/groups/glassfish\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://maven.glassfish.org/content/groups/glassfish</a>) to obtain the dependency and also notes the following from an Oracle employee: \"In the future, the plan is to publish the Java EE API JARs to Maven central.  Community should be able to set dependencies on Java EE API artifacts w/o adding repository element.\"</p>",
     "created": "30/Jun/11 3:54 PM",
